{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ska944","slide":1,"text":"Candidate C high-fidelity hybrid editable figure.\nCanonical source: source/hybrid_figure.json\nRaster modules are deliberately bounded, cropped, and replaceable:\n- noise-raster-atom: assets/noise.png\n- reconstruction-raster-atom: assets/reconstruction.png\nAuthoritative equations (embedded SVG with retained LaTeX):\n- eq_z: z\n- eq_generator: G_{\\theta}\n- eq_xhat: \\hat{x}\n- eq_operator: A\n- eq_yhat: \\hat{y}\n- eq_y: y\n- eq_loss: \\lVert\\hat{y}-y\\rVert_{2}^{2}\n- eq_objective: \\theta^{\\ast}=\\operatorname*{arg\\,min}_{\\theta}\\left\\lVert A G_{\\theta}(z)-y\\right\\rVert_{2}^{2}\n- eq_reconstruction: \\hat{x}=G_{\\theta^{\\ast}}(z)\nNo full-canvas raster is present; frames, network, plots, labels, connectors, and arrowheads are native objects.\n[Sources]\n- assets/noise.png — local publication-safe figure module.\n- assets/reconstruction.png — local publication-safe figure module.\n- equations/eq_z.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_generator.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_xhat.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_operator.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_yhat.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_y.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_loss.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_objective.svg — locally rendered vector equation.\n- equations/eq_reconstruction.svg — locally rendered vector equation."}